      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #30"
    },
    {
      "duration" : 6.765850340136054,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_031_操夢.wav",
      "id" : "2B94F705-68A7-485A-AAAE-1B7E66A40CC9",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "コンピューターの基盤と共に小さな加湿器が埋め込まれていて、そこから、空気が出ていたようだった。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.031.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 6.165850340136054,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 31",
      "backgroundName" : "nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #31"
    },
    {
      "duration" : 8.73,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_032_操夢.wav",
      "id" : "674AB577-4C23-4476-9592-9B6995FD2726",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "僕はそれを取り出し、加湿器を取り出してみる。すると、そこには謎の液体と共に、小さなメモ用紙貼り付けられていた。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.032.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.13,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 32",
      "backgroundName" : "nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #32"
    },
    {
      "duration" : 8.657165532879818,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_033_操夢.wav",
      "id" : "3AD6430B-D235-4B34-A894-4DB3157AED0A",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "メモ用紙には、この加湿器の差出人と、納付先が記載されていた。「八雲紫依頼の品を、にとりに納付」っと…。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.033.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.057165532879818,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 33",
      "backgroundName" : "nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #33"
    },
    {
      "duration" : 9.408253968253968,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_034_操夢.wav",
      "id" : "669042AF-4C67-4B6E-92E9-898CF1A41BE4",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "そして、僕はあることに気がつく。わざわざ発電所から直に給電させたのは、加湿器から爆速であの空気を広めるためなのだと…",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.034.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.808253968253968,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 34",
      "backgroundName" : "nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #34"
    },
    {
      "duration" : 4.839773242630385,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_035_操夢.wav",
      "id" : "9613CFA0-71D6-44C7-A20A-D2055925FDC5",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "僕は、その加湿器だけ、抜き取ると、あの部屋に持って行った。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.035.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 4.239773242630386,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 35",
      "backgroundName" : "nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #35"
    },
    {
      "backgroundName" : "単色背景",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.036.jpeg",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "その頃、紫は…",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #36",
      "id" : "CD7EA8FD-9D06-4711-82B5-68804FB0E5A2",
      "duration" : 3,
      "characterName" : "八雲紫",
      "title" : "シーン 36: その頃、紫は…",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "transitionName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.037.jpeg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "私と魔理沙は、あれから霖之助に問い詰めた後、\n真犯人を把握し、その犯人の家にやってきて会議を開いた。",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #37",
      "id" : "A6F4B7F4-28BC-4B85-A6A7-4D8F197FAEA8",
      "duration" : 9.244489795918367,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_037_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 37",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.644489795918368,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "transitionName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.038.jpeg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "八雲紫",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "「えっと…みなさんお揃いで、どんな御用でしょうか…？」",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #38",
      "id" : "D79DB5CF-9BFD-4CDE-A0A0-97558D25300A",
      "duration" : 3.7319727891156464,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_038_八雲紫.wav",
      "characterName" : "八雲紫",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 38",
      "voiceDuration" : 3.1319727891156464,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "transitionName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.039.jpeg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "bgmName" : "[BGM] 自主規制ピー音.mp3",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "「私たちは知ってるのよ、外の世界から持ってきた⚪︎薬加湿器を、一緒に持ってきた機械に埋め込んで、香霖堂に送ったの。」",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #39",
      "id" : "A27D107C-2904-4580-A1CE-74EA8198E772",
      "duration" : 9.906984126984126,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_039_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "bgmAudioPath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/自主規制ピー音.mp3",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 39",
      "voiceDuration" : 9.306984126984126,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "transitionName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf\/東方惑情録　第７話_add878d3bf.040.jpeg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "八雲紫",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "「えっと…それには、訳がありまして…」",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #40",
      "id" : "FE34EC69-5757-4D78-BA70-3FF4C221162D",
      "duration" : 3.031292517006803,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_040_八雲紫.wav",
      "characterName" : "八雲紫",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 40",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.4312925170068027,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "transitionName" : "なし"
    },
    {
